give @s written_book{title:"Culling",author:"lollip0529",pages:['["", {"text": "Culling\\n\\n", "bold": true}, "Why the portal room\'s spawner doesn\'t spike in the pie from where you start.\\n\\nThe game only draws what it finds by looking through open air, one 16x16x16 block cube at a time."]','["", {"text": "Too far (64+)\\n\\n", "bold": true}, "Spawners only show in the pie within 64 blocks of you, and this one is farther.", "\\n\\n", {"text": "Fix: ", "bold": true}, "Get closer. It renders once you\'re within 64 blocks."]','["", {"text": "Directionality\\n\\n", "bold": true}, "The game checks each cube only once, from the first side it reaches. Nothing doubles back: a closer cube is just reached from the wrong side first.", "\\n\\n", {"text": "Fix: ", "bold": true}, "No sure fix. Move, or look up or down to hide the wrong way."]','["", {"text": "Vertical culling\\n\\n", "bold": true}, "Once the game has looked down it can\'t look back up, and the other way round. The way to the spawner goes up or down and has to come back, so it\'s missed.", "\\n\\n", {"text": "Fix: ", "bold": true}, "Change your Y level past a multiple of 16 (like Y 32)."]','["", {"text": "Horizontal culling\\n\\n", "bold": true}, "Like vertical, but sideways: once the game has looked east it can\'t look back west, or north to south. The way to the spawner doubles back sideways, so it\'s missed.", "\\n\\n", {"text": "Fix: ", "bold": true}, "Walk into the next chunk over."]','["", {"text": "Lack of air\\n\\n", "bold": true}, "The air near the portal room doesn\'t join up with the air near you in a way the game can follow, so it never finds the spawner, whichever way it looks.", "\\n\\n", {"text": "Fix: ", "bold": true}, "Try another spot, or dig toward the portal room."]','["", {"text": "Flush hidden\\n\\n", "bold": true}, "There is no open air at all between you and the spawner: solid blocks close off the way in.", "\\n\\n", {"text": "Fix: ", "bold": true}, "Check the 5-way for hiddens that are flush with chunk borders."]','["", {"text": "Chunk border\\n\\n", "bold": true}, "The game starts looking from the cube you stand in, and from this one it never reaches the spawner.", "\\n\\n", {"text": "Fix: ", "bold": true}, "Walk into the next chunk on the same level. Often that\'s only a step or two away."]','["", {"text": "Angle\\n\\n", "bold": true}, "The game only looks at what\'s on your screen. A tall, thin view can be so narrow that no way to the spawner fits, whichever way you turn.", "\\n\\n", {"text": "Fix: ", "bold": true}, "EyeZoom: check on Thin.\\nThin: try 30 FOV."]','["", {"text": "Ghost spike\\n\\n", "bold": true}, "It spikes only while you face away from the portal room. The game counts the spawner\'s whole 16x16x16 cube if any corner is on screen, and Thin and EyeZoom see far up and down. Hiding off-screen cubes can also open another way in."]','["", {"text": "Fix: ", "bold": true}, "Confirm it from a second spot before sending."]']}
